{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTICE: Hanturium is evolving into COMANOMALY with new art and title. We're still in the process of this transformation, you might encounter some bugs in the demo, thank you for your understanding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>COMANOMALY </strong><i>( was: Hanturium )</i><strong>\u00a0</strong>is a mix between whodunnit mystery and horror game, with different randomly selected culprit each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title is a portmanteau of <strong>Coma<i>\u00a0</i></strong><i>(state of deep unconsciousness)</i> and <strong>Anomaly\u00a0</strong><i>(abnormalities)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our demo is frequently updated, so check often, or click the <strong>follow</strong> / <strong>wishlist</strong> button above to be informed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.poster.avif?t=1768498244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.webm?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.mp4?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/ac903af571d21d6127502ce5b32a1696.avif?t=1768498244\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude7a It's 1985.\u00a0You are <strong>Susi</strong>, a nurse working for <strong>Sudaritra Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a very wealthy and powerful patient was admitted to the hospital with weird symptoms and peculiar conditions: <strong>Reynald Suroso</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\u2695\ufe0f A family doctor.<br>\ud83d\udd2e A family &quot;spiritual guide&quot;.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f A backstabbing family member, trying to kill the patient.<br><br>What could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Play COMANOMALY, and your tasks will be\u00a0:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Examine the <strong>anomalies</strong> left by mystical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd Find <strong>notes</strong> left by the doctor and the shaman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Check the <strong>life support machine</strong> and mark abnormal medical symptoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Pay attention to <strong>dialogues</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and the <strong>environment</strong> to uncover the culprit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Try to get the <strong>best possible completion time</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.poster.avif?t=1768498244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.webm?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.mp4?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>COMANOMALY is still in active development</strong>. As such, many aspects of the demo are not final and may change in the future. If you find a bug, or if there are parts of the game you don\u2019t enjoy, please let us know so we can improve its quality.\u00a0\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR: Game is still in development; suggestions are very welcome.</strong>\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.poster.avif?t=1768498244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.webm?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.mp4?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/5c04ab09c9731f34b0de2d7c3456b49b.avif?t=1768498244\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u00a0 : A, S, W, D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint\u00a0 : Shift (while moving)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look\u00a0: Move Mouse\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action\u00a0:\u00a0 E</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue\u00a0 :\u00a0 R / Left mouse click\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu / Pause (in-game)\u00a0 :\u00a0 F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Intro\u00a0 :\u00a0 F (hold)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /