trong> to uncover the culprit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Try to get the <strong>best possible completion time</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.poster.avif?t=1768498244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.webm?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.mp4?t=1768498244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1768498244\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>COMANOMALY is still in active development</strong>. As such, many aspects of the demo are not final and may change in the future. If you find a bug, or if there are parts of the game you don\u2019t enjoy, please let us know so we can improve its quality.\u00a0\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR: Game is still in development; suggestions are very welcome.</strong>\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\